      "id": "project-hypno-context",
      "type": "text",
      "width": "full",
      "heading": "ATMOSPHERE AS THE PRIMARY MECHANIC",
      "body": "Project Hypno was our first attempt at a horror game. I wrote the script in a week and we developed the prototype around the kind of deep, tactile simulation we loved in Voices of the Void, searching for a player fantasy that could support those mechanics rather than simply copying their surface.\n\nThe two-week project pushed me into unfamiliar territory: modeling, PBR materials, spatial sound design and the pacing of a horror atmosphere. It proved that we could create the mood, but not yet the larger gameplay framework that would sustain it.",
